== arm p3: prefix vs its causal twin (lower is better)
  twin, causal          0.4643   <- baseline, an existing 500-step run
  arm,  prefix p3      0.4871   delta +0.0228   <- THE EXPERIMENT
  arm,  causal          0.4612   delta -0.0031   <- mismatch control
  If the mismatch cell is far larger than the matched delta, the number is the mask mismatch and not the intervention -- Stage A's failure mode.
